            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Employees who do not pass the current EKI exam, or refuse the offer of preferential reemployment, will not be considered for future preferential reemployment pursuant to Section 2(a) above. Such employees will remain on the recall list for classifications previously held in.",
